    "description": "On the Add people page, the line under the Participant role (eventsRoleLabelParticipant) saying what the person added may do: answer the invitation, vote on the proposed dates and on the games, and bring games of their own."
  },
  "eventsRoleDescriptionGuest": "Answers and votes on dates. Can't nominate or vote on games.",
  "@eventsRoleDescriptionGuest": {
    "description": "On the Add people page, the line under the Guest role (eventsRoleLabelGuest) saying what the person added may do: answer the invitation and vote on the proposed dates, but not put a game forward for the event or vote on one."
  },
  "eventsRoleDescriptionSpectator": "Comes to watch. Answers whether they're coming, and has no vote.",
  "@eventsRoleDescriptionSpectator": {
    "description": "On the Add people page, the line under the Spectator role (eventsRoleLabelSpectator) saying what the person added may do: come to watch rather than play, and answer whether they're coming, with no vote on the dates or the games."
  },
  "eventsRoleDescriptionCoHost": "Runs the event with you: its dates, people and games. Can't delete it.",
  "@eventsRoleDescriptionCoHost": {
    "description": "On the Add people page, the line under the Co-host role (eventsRoleLabelCoHost) saying what the person added may do: run the event alongside the user, its dates, who's on it and its games, everything but delete it. 'You' is the user adding them."
  },
  "eventsRoleDescriptionOrganizer": "Edits the event, proposes dates, and adds or removes participants, guests and spectators.",
  "@eventsRoleDescriptionOrganizer": {
    "description": "On the Add people page, the line under the Organizer role (eventsRoleLabelOrganizer) saying what the person added may do: change the event's details, propose dates, and add people to it or take them off, but only participants, guests and spectators."
